    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a traditional jrpg game, turn-based with unique moments and a fascinating story focused on the purple light\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thays Tanari and Dunar Moonsong embark on an extremely dangerous journey to find the five elements in Dimension Two. They end up making a new friend in this dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The three girls join together to explore Dimension Two, but they have no idea that it is dominated by Subtwo and Zhenya Zarele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During this journey, Dunar discovers that Dimension Two hides secrets about the purple light\u2019s past, and she needs to solve all the questions involving her own past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOver 30 hours of gameplay;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t3 worlds with many regions to explore;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tFemale characters to play;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tMonster bestiary to complete;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTurn-based battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTrade your items with NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTwo gameplay mechanics to play. Thays and Dunar are playable in this game.;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tColorful environments;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t1 bloody environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOver 1 hour of soundtrack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tRich story and many dialogues;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tEach city has your own unique NPCs. This game doesn\u2019t repeat NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTwo endings to explore.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a traditional jrpg game, turn-based with unique moments and a fascinating story focused on the purple light\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thays Tanari and Dunar Moonsong embark on an extremely dangerous journey to find the five elements in Dimension Two. They end up making a new friend in this dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The three girls join together to explore Dimension Two, but they have no idea that it is dominated by Subtwo and Zhenya Zarele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During this journey, Dunar discovers that Dimension Two hides secrets about the purple light\u2019s past, and she needs to solve all the questions involving her own past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOver 30 hours of gameplay;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t3 worlds with many regions to explore;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tFemale characters to play;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tMonster bestiary to complete;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTurn-based battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTrade your items with NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTwo gameplay mechanics to play. Thays and Dunar are playable in this game.;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tColorful environments;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t1 bloody environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOver 1 hour of soundtrack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tRich story and many dialogues;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tEach city has your own unique NPCs. This game doesn\u2019t repeat NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTwo endings to explore.</p>",
